'''Buchu leaf''' is a [[herb]] found within the [[Chambers of Xeric]] by cleaning a [[grimy buchu leaf]]. It can be grown with a [[Farming]] level of 39, by planting [[buchu seed]]s in [[Herb_patch_(Chambers_of_Xeric)|herb patches]] found within resource rooms. 52 [[Herblore]] is required to clean the grimy herb.

Unlike other potions, a secondary ingredient must be present in the player's inventory before it can be used on a [[water-filled gourd vial]] to create the potions listed below.

